{18}{[The man squares himself to you, putting his hands on his hips.]  That sounds like a threat, my good man.  No room for that sort of thing in my book.  Someone might expect this affair to come to blows with words like that coming out of your mouth.  Are you quite ready for that, sir...?}{[The man squares himself to you, putting his hands on his hips.]  That sounds like a threat, madam.  I'm not one to raise my hand to a woman, but a man might expect this affair to come to blows with words like that coming out of your mouth.  Is that your intention, madam?}{}{3}{}{}
