{25}{[The man smiles, broadly.]  Yes, of course!  Where is my head at these days?  So much going on, preparations to be made and all that!  My manners have seem to have flown south!  My apologies, sir!}{[The man smiles, broadly.]  Yes, of course!  Where is my head at these days?  So much going on, preparations to be made and all that!  My manners have seem to have flown south!  My apologies, madam!}{}{5}{}{}
