{52}{Oh, just stopping in for supplies.  That, and I've just added another head to my collection here in the den.  [He gestures to the wall.]  Finally bagged myself a Howling Bog Dweller up in the Dark Fens!  20 feet of him, and bloody tough, too!  They almost shipped me home in an ice barrel!}{Oh, just stopping in for supplies.  That, and I've just added another head to my collection here in the den.  [He gestures to the wall.]  Finally bagged myself a Howling Bog Dweller up in the Dark Fens!  20 feet of him, and bloody tough, too!  They almost shipped me home in an ice barrel!}{}{9}{}{}
