{58}{Well, wouldn't you know it, my blunderbuss, Old Mary, gave up the ghost just as the beast was charging!  Have you ever seen a raging Howler set his sights on you?  Enough to give you a good case of the muckies!  Ha! }{Well, wouldn't you know it, my blunderbuss, Old Mary, gave up the ghost just as the beast was charging!  Have you ever seen a raging Howler set his sights on you?  Enough to give you a good case of the muckies!  Ha! }{}{10}{}{}
