{89}{Why, for whatever the next adventure is, my good friend!   One can never be too prepared, you know!  My kingdom for a compass, and all that!  Ha!  We're pushing off at first light!  Or was it the day after tomorrow...?  Whichever!  It's a big world out there, full of mystery and danger...no time to waste!}{Why, for whatever the next adventure is, my good friend!   One can never be too prepared, you know!  My kingdom for a compass, and all that!  Ha!  We're pushing off at first light!  Or was it the day after tomorrow...?  Whichever!  It's a big world out there, full of mystery and danger...no time to waste!}{}{15}{}{}
{90}{K:}{}{1}{}{40}{}
