{93}{Adventures?  Mine?  Oh, there's really not much to tell.  Bloody newspapers are always blowing these things out of proportion!  You'd think they'd never heard of a man fighting a pair of Fire-Giants with his bare hands!  Standard fare, really...nothing you'd be terribly interested in...}{Adventures?  Mine?  Oh, there's really not much to tell.  Bloody newspapers are always blowing these things out of proportion!  You'd think they'd never heard of a man fighting a pair of Fire-Giants with his bare hands!  Standard fare, really...nothing you'd be terribly interested in...}{}{16}{}{}
