{111}{What?  You know Edward Teach?  Well, isn't that just the colonel's codpiece!  Captain Teach is one of the greatest sailors in all of Arcanum!  And that boat of his!  The Gypsy Shadow!  Not a more solid piece of shipwork between here and the Serpentspine!  Fancy that!  Ha!  Jolly good!  So the captain told you the story, already?}{What?  You know Edward Teach?  Well, isn't that just the colonel's codpiece!  Captain Teach is one of the greatest sailors in all of Arcanum!  And that boat of his!  The Gypsy Shadow!  Not a more solid piece of shipwork between here and the Serpentspine!  Fancy that!  Ha!  Jolly good!  So the captain told you the story, already?}{}{18}{}{}
{112}{Yes...but why don't you tell me YOUR version, Franklin...}{}{5}{}{117}{}
{113}{Yes...but I'd love to hear more of your adventures...}{}{5}{}{99}{}
{114}{K:}{}{5}{}{40}{}
{115}{E:}{}{5}{}{0}{}
{117}{Alright!  So, there we were, Captain Teach and I...hundreds of miles away from the mainland, the bloody volcanic Serpentspine mountains belching lava above us, and the dreaded Shade Sharks below, as big as the Gypsy Shadow herself.  Half the men were on their knees on the deck, praying for a quick and painless death!}{Alright!  So, there we were, Captain Teach and I...hundreds of miles away from the mainland, the bloody volcanic Serpentspine mountains belching lava above us, and the dreaded Shade Sharks below, as big as the Gypsy Shadow herself.  Half the men were on their knees on the deck, praying for a quick and painless death!}{}{19}{}{}
{118}{And so?  What happened?}{}{5}{}{121}{}
{119}{Uh...whut did you do?}{}{-4}{}{121}{}
{121}{Well...I was there to get some fire-gems, and so that's just what I was going to do!  Unfortunately, the Fire Giants who owned them weren't being very cooperative.  Have you ever spoken with a Fire Giant?  Breath like the rear end of a Dreadhound bitch in heat!  And bad grammar to top it off!  Ha!}{Well...I was there to get some fire-gems, and so that's just what I was going to do!  Unfortunately, the Fire Giants who owned them weren't being very cooperative.  Have you ever spoken with a Fire Giant?  Breath like the rear end of a Dreadhound bitch in heat!  And bad grammar to top it off!  Ha!}{}{20}{}{}
{122}{How did you get the gems?}{}{5}{}{125}{}
{123}{How you get f-fire j-jem-m-s?}{}{-4}{}{125}{}
{125}{Well, like a complete idiot I'd forgotten Old Mary on the boat, and all I had was an old rusted sword!  I realized that was bloody useless after the first swing, so I tossed it aside.  Now, normally I'd not resort to fisticuffs with a family of Fire-Giants, but what was I to do?}{Well, like a complete idiot I'd forgotten Old Mary on the boat, and all I had was an old rusted sword!  I realized that was bloody useless after the first swing, so I tossed it aside.  Now, normally I'd not resort to fisticuffs with a family of Fire-Giants, but what was I to do?}{}{21}{}{}
{126}{Yes, what...?}{}{5}{}{129}{}
{127}{Uh...}{}{-4}{}{129}{}
{129}{Well, with a bit of luck and a few well-placed blows, I was running back to the boat with a handful of fire-gems!  Enough to scare a man out of his skivvies, but a brilliant time all around!  Ha!  Wouldn't have missed it for the world!}{Well, with a bit of luck and a few well-placed blows, I was running back to the boat with a handful of fire-gems!  Enough to scare a man out of his skivvies, but a brilliant time all around!  Ha!  Wouldn't have missed it for the world!}{}{22}{}{}
{130}{I'd love to hear about more of your adventures...}{}{5}{}{99}{}
{131}{More stories!}{}{-4}{}{99}{}
