{133}{E:}{}{1}{}{0}{}
{135}{I don't know if you're a religious sort, but every now and again I'll do some work for the Panarii church.  They've always got work for a man who's not afraid to dirty his hands...}{I don't know if you're a religious sort, but every now and again I'll do some work for the Panarii church.  They've always got work for a man who's not afraid to dirty his hands...}{}{23}{}{}
{136}{I've met Hadrian, the church archaeologist.  He mentioned you...}{}{5}{gf 2294 1}{142}{re +5}
