{161}{Alright!  Well, I was on safari in Stillwater...on the track of that dreaded beast, the Stillwater Giant...}{Alright!  Well, I was on safari in Stillwater...on the track of that dreaded beast, the Stillwater Giant...}{}{28}{}{}
{162}{Yes...?}{}{5}{}{165}{}
{163}{Uh...}{}{-4}{}{165}{}
{164}{K:}{}{1}{lf6 1}{266}{}
{165}{Somehow I'd been separated from my party, and I was searching a cave I found in the forest.  And in the back of that cave I found a small, blue rabbit!  Blue like a baboon's backside!  Bloody strange, but I wasn't on the hunt for that sort of thing, so I turned to go...}{Somehow I'd been separated from my party, and I was searching a cave I found in the forest.  And in the back of that cave I found a small, blue rabbit!  Blue like a baboon's backside!  Bloody strange, but I wasn't on the hunt for that sort of thing, so I turned to go...}{}{29}{}{}
{166}{Wait...don't tell me...}{}{5}{}{169}{}
{167}{Uh...whut you do?}{}{-4}{}{169}{}
{168}{K:}{}{1}{lf6 1}{266}{}
{169}{As soon as I turned, I heard something move behind me.  Something BIG.  So I looked back, and there standing in front of me was the most awful creature I've ever seen...!}{As soon as I turned, I heard something move behind me.  Something BIG.  So I looked back, and there standing in front of me was the most awful creature I've ever seen...!}{}{30}{}{}
{170}{Let me guess...huge, shaggy, big antlers on its head...}{}{5}{}{173}{}
{171}{Huh?}{}{-4}{}{173}{}
{172}{K:}{}{1}{lf6 1}{266}{}
{173}{Too right!  Ha!  This thing was terrible!  Hairy bugger, and it smelled like a bloated Corpse Hog!  A mouth full of teeth like foot-long razors, bloodstained claws on its hands and feet, and a pair of 6 foot antlers on its head!  I'm no coward, old boy, but I've got no problem telling you that I just about filled my union suit!}{Too right!  Ha!  This thing was terrible!  Hairy bugger, and it smelled like a bloated Corpse Hog!  A mouth full of teeth like foot-long razors, bloodstained claws on its hands and feet!  Excuse the expression, madam, but I've got no problem telling you that I just about filled my union suit!}{}{31}{}{}
{174}{And so?}{}{5}{}{177}{}
{175}{Uh...}{}{-4}{}{177}{}
{176}{K:}{}{1}{lf6 1}{266}{}
{177}{So?  This was the Stillwater Giant!  He was my quarry, and nothing else mattered!  My trusted blunderbuss, Old Mary, was all botched up, so I had only a small knife with which to battle the mythical beast!  The fight raged for what seemed like hours!  More than a few times I thought I was dead as mutton!}{So?  This was the Stillwater Giant!  He was my quarry, and nothing else mattered!  My trusted blunderbuss, Old Mary, was all botched up, so I had only a small knife with which to battle the mythical beast!  The fight raged for what seemed like hours!  More than a few times I thought I was dead as mutton!}{}{32}{}{}
{178}{What happened?}{}{5}{}{181}{}
{179}{Whut you do?}{}{-4}{}{181}{}
{180}{K:}{}{1}{lf6 1}{266}{}
{181}{Somehow, I got the upper hand!  And just as I was about to dispatch the beast once and for all, the bugger changed back into a bloody rabbit and hopped away!  Dash it! Of all the bad luck!  Ha!}{Somehow, I got the upper hand!  And just as I was about to dispatch the beast once and for all, the bugger changed back into a bloody rabbit and hopped away!  Dash it!  Of all the bad luck!  Ha!}{}{33}{}{}
{182}{Franklin, you can't possibly expect me to believe that story!}{}{5}{gf2295 0, lf6 0}{194}{re -5}
