{224}{Oh!  By far the most dangerous place I've ever been is the Isle of Thanatos!  They call it Monster Island, or some such, but what they should call the bloody place is Hell!  Ha!  I've never seen a more complete collection of the world's most abominably evil creatures in all my life!  Words can't possibly describe the danger!  Absolutely fantastic!  Can't wait to go back!}{Oh!  By far the most dangerous place I've ever been is the Isle of Thanatos!  They call it Monster Island, or some such, but what they should call the bloody place is Hell!  Ha!  I've never seen a more complete collection of the world's most abominably evil creatures in all my life!  Words can't possibly describe the danger!  Absolutely fantastic!  Can't wait to go back!}{}{41}{}{}
{225}{That's interesting.  I just happen to be going there myself...}{}{5}{lf5 0}{230}{}
{226}{Hey!  I going to Thanatos!}{}{-4}{}{230}{}
{227}{K:}{}{1}{}{40}{}
{228}{E:}{}{1}{}{0}{}
{230}{Really?  Brilliant!  Sounds like a smashing good time!   Hoist the Jolly Roger and all that!  Good luck to you!}{Really?  Brilliant!  Sounds like a smashing good time!   Hoist the Jolly Roger and all that!  Good luck to you!}{}{42}{}{}
{231}{You know, Franklin, I could use a man like you when I get there...}{}{5}{qu1100 6}{237}{lf5 1}
{232}{You know, Franklin, I could use a man like you when I get there...}{}{5}{qb1100 5}{255}{lf3 1}
