{235}{E:}{}{1}{}{0}{}
{237}{Wait a moment...what did you say you're name was...?}{Wait a moment...what did you say you're name was...?}{}{43}{}{}
{238}{I didn't.  My name is @PCNAME@.}{}{5}{}{240}{}
{240}{Why, you're the fool who bungled the Whytechurch Murderer case in Caladon!  I thought I recognized you.  I had to clean up your bloody mess, what?  That demon was no cup of tea, either!  Had the most terrible time finishing that one off...}{Why, you're the fool who bungled the Whytechurch Murderer case in Caladon!  I thought I recognized you.  I had to clean up your bloody mess, what?  That demon was no cup of tea, either!  Had the most terrible time finishing that one off...}{}{44}{}{}
{241}{Well, I could still use your help...}{}{5}{}{245}{}
{242}{I don't particularly enjoy being called a fool...}{}{5}{}{250}{re -5}
{243}{E:}{}{5}{}{0}{}
{245}{Sorry, old friend.  Thanatos is no place to go with someone who can't finish their business.  I wish you luck, but you'll be going without me...}{Sorry, old friend.  Thanatos is no place to go with someone who can't finish their business.  I wish you luck, but you'll be going without me...}{}{45}{}{}
{246}{I don't think I like the way you're referring to me...}{}{5}{}{250}{}
{247}{K:}{}{5}{}{40}{}
