{250}{[He moves a step closer, smiling all the while.]  I don't believe I bloody care what you like or don't like, old chap.  Your blundering cost more than one person their life, so I'll call you whatever the hell I fancy.  Are we clear on that...?}{[He moves a step closer, smiling all the while.]  I don't believe I bloody care what you like or don't like, madam.  Your blundering cost more than one person their life, so I'll call you whatever the hell I fancy.  Are we clear on that...?}{}{46}{}{}
{251}{I've heard enough of your blustering.  Time to put an end to it...}{}{5}{}{}{co, fl 23}
{252}{Yes, very.  Might I ask you a few more questions?}{}{5}{}{40}{}
