{423}{Looks like Shrouded Hills to me!  Not a whole lot to do in this little town, but I think there's a haunted mine around here somewhere!  Chock full of monsters, I'm sure!  Ha!  Sounds like a jolly good time!}{Looks like Shrouded Hills to me!  Not a whole lot to do in this little town, but I think there's a haunted mine around here somewhere!  Chock full of monsters, I'm sure!  Ha!  Sounds like a jolly good time!}{}{61}{}{}
