{455}{E:}{}{1}{}{0}{}
{457}{What do I know about Thanatos?  What don't I know about it, old chap?  Uncharted territories, evil man-eating beasts, and more myths and legends than a damned elven historian!  Ha HA!  No place I'd rather be!}{What do I know about Thanatos?  What don't I know about it, madam?  Uncharted territories, evil man-eating beasts, and more myths and legends than a damned elven historian!  Ha HA!  No place I'd rather be!}{}{69}{}{}
{458}{K:}{}{1}{}{266}{}
{459}{E:}{}{1}{}{0}{}
{593}{Thanatos!  I've told you...its a wonderful place, full of deadly creatures and various other unknown and probably fatal dangers.  Just the kind of place I want to be!  Ha!}{Thanatos!  I've told you...its a wonderful place, full of deadly creatures and various other unknown and probably fatal dangers.  Just the kind of place I want to be!  Ha!}{}{75}{}{}
{594}{One or two more things...}{}{5}{}{266}{}
