{598}{I can't say as I've ever even heard of the Vendigroth ruins, but the Vendigroth Wastes...now there's a place where any self-respecting adventurer would feel right at home!  If the scorching sun doesn't get you, the myriad man-eating beasts will!  I can't think of a better time!}{I can't say as I've ever even heard of the Vendigroth ruins, but the Vendigroth Wastes...now there's a place where any self-respecting adventurer would feel right at home!  If the scorching sun doesn't get you, the myriad man-eating beasts will!  I can't think of a better time!}{}{76}{}{}
{599}{One or two more things...}{}{5}{}{266}{}
{600}{Uh...I need sumthin' else...!}{}{-4}{}{266}{}
{601}{E:}{}{1}{}{0}{}
{603}{The Ring of Brodgar...hmmm...oh yes...right outside of Roseborough.  Never actually been there, myself...that part of the country hasn't been good for adventuring in a long time, you know.  But you never know what you'll find 'til you get there.  I'm game if you are!}{The Ring of Brodgar...hmmm...oh yes...right outside of Roseborough.  Never actually been there, myself...that part of the country hasn't been good for adventuring in a long time, you know.  But you never know what you'll find 'til you get there.  I'm game if you are!}{}{77}{}{}
{604}{One or two more things...}{}{5}{}{266}{}
{605}{Uh...I need sumthin' else...!}{}{-4}{}{266}{}
{606}{E:}{}{1}{}{0}{}
{608}{Arronax?  Now there's a novel idea...going after the most evil bugger of them all!  HA!  Wouldn't it make a great story!  But, I must say, I'm a loss as to how we'd find the old elf...didn't he get banished or something like that?  I don't know a bloody soul in Arcanum who does that sort of thing.  Oh well!  I'm sure the answer will come to us eventually...}{Arronax?  Now there's a novel idea...going after the most evil bugger of them all!  HA!  Wouldn't it make a great story!  But, I must say, I'm a loss as to how we'd find the old elf...didn't he get banished or something like that?  I don't know a bloody soul in Arcanum who does that sort of thing.  Oh well!  I'm sure the answer will come to us eventually...}{}{78}{}{}
{609}{One or two more things...}{}{5}{}{266}{}
{610}{Uh...I need sumthin' else...!}{}{-4}{}{266}{}
{611}{E:}{}{1}{}{0}{}
{613}{The Void?  It's about the only place I haven't been to at one time or another.  Always was so damned difficult to get there...now we're here, and I don't have the foggiest idea as to where we are, or what we should be doing!  I've give my bloody firstborn for a map of the place. HA!}{The Void?  It's about the only place I haven't been to at one time or another.  Always was so damned difficult to get there...now we're here, and I don't have the foggiest idea as to where we are, or what we should be doing!  I've give my bloody firstborn for a map of the place!  HA!}{}{79}{}{}
{614}{One or two more things...}{}{5}{}{266}{}
{615}{Uh...I need sumthin' else...!}{}{-4}{}{266}{}
{616}{E:}{}{1}{}{0}{}
{618}{Kerghan?  Oh, the old Necromancer?  Fairly morbid chap, I'm sure.  Can't say as to how I'd be very anxious to meet him...he's probably none too happy about being sent here all those years ago.  But, I'm ready to face the bastard if you are!  We'll show the old grave robber a thing or two!}{Kerghan?  Oh, the old Necromancer?  Fairly morbid chap, I'm sure.  Can't say as to how I'd be very anxious to meet him...he's probably none too happy about being sent here all those years ago.  But, I'm ready to face the bastard if you are!  We'll show the old grave robber a thing or two!}{}{80}{}{}
{619}{One or two more things...}{}{5}{}{266}{}
{620}{Uh...I need sumthin' else...!}{}{-4}{}{266}{}
